<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Massachusetts Port Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Massachusetts Port Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>MASSACHUSETTS PORT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $159,795,000</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
